# One ending in the repository, whatever the machine that wrote the file does.
# Without this a checkout on Windows and a checkout on Linux disagree about the
# bytes of every file, and the three operating systems in the test matrix stop
# being a test of the code.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Line counts and diffs on the generated documents are noise in review. They
# are rebuilt by a command and checked by CI, so read them there.
docs/*.md linguist-generated=true
migrations.lock linguist-generated=true
